type: software
title: "Governed Metric Decisions: Reproducibility Artifact"
abstract: >-
  Frozen benchmark records, model-decision outputs, evaluation scripts, and
  audit evidence for the empirical study of pre-execution execute, clarify,
  and reject decisions for governed metric requests. Supports offline
  regeneration and verification of reported analyses without live model inference.
